### GET Reviews

GET {{base_url}}/reviewed-client/{{reviewed_client_id}}/reviews/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET Reviews Summary

GET {{base_url}}/reviewed-client/{{reviewed_client_id}}/reviews/summary/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET My Review

GET {{base_url}}/reviewed-client/{{reviewed_client_id}}/reviews/my-review/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### POST Review

POST {{base_url}}/reviewed-client/{{reviewed_client_id}}/reviews/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ratings": 5,
  "tags": [
    2,
    4,
    5
  ]
}
